# Lens profiles.
lens_profiles.invalid = Pona base de données ya XML ya Lensfun v1/v2 oyo ezali malamu (kino 8 MiB) na ba données ya caméra to ya objectif oyo esungami.
lens_profiles.calibration = Calibration ya lentille
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Calibration moko te ezo couvrir ba paramètres wana. Vérifier distance focale na facteur ya crop ya caméra; correction manuel etikali kozala.
lens_profiles.import = Importer XML ya Lensfun...
lens_profiles.imported = Base ya ba données ya Lensfun importé pona session oyo. Pona profil to ko correspondre na ba métadonnées ya photo.
lens_profiles.manual = Correction manuel kaka
lens_profiles.saved = Calibration oyo ebombami (base ya ba données ezali te) .
lens_profiles.profile = Profil ya lente
lens_profiles.aperture = Ouverture (0 = eyebani te) .
lens_profiles.distance = Distance ya focus (0 = eyebani te) .
lens_profiles.vignette = Vignetting oyo esalemi na calibré
lens_profiles.color_context = Vignetting calibré esengaka profil sRGB oyo etongami na kati. Bobongola na sRGB mpo na kobatela komonana, na nsima fungola lisusu Kobongisa lantiye. Mpo na ba pixels oyo ezali déjà-sRGB oyo ezali na bilembo te, kopesa sRGB ekoki. Géométrie mpe correction chromatique etikali.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Calibration ya vignetting moko te ezipaka ouverture na distance ya focus. Tyá motuya oyo emekami mpo na kofungola yango; 1000 m ezali komonisa focus ya mosika na ba profils mingi ya Lensfun.
lens_profiles.note = Correction calibrée esalemaka liboso ya ba contrôles manuels. Salelá cadre mobimba ya ebandeli; katá yango na nsima. Bomba ebele ya filtre na PSD/PSB mpo na kobatela calibration oyo ekoki kobongisama.
lens_profiles.automatic = Bokokanisa ba métadonnées ya ba photos
lens_profiles.components = Koleka ya profil: bobebisi {distortion}; ba franges ya langi {tca}; kosala vignette {vignette}.
